<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cutter &amp; Buck rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cutter &amp; Buck rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Diane Daggatt said Tuesday she initiated coverage of Cutter &amp; Buck Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Cutter &amp; Buck markets men's sportswear and outerwear.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 7/8 at 15-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Daggatt estimates Cutter &amp; Buck earnings at $0.72 a share for fiscal 1997, up from $0.29 a year ago, and $0.96 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
